# Docker build context for the Fly.io image (see Dockerfile, deploy/README.md).
# Whitelist: everything is excluded unless re-included below. That keeps out
# node_modules, target/ (Rust/Anchor builds, ~3.7 GB), .git, game/.godot,
# programs/, docs/ (presentations), art/ sources, tools/ (+ __pycache__),
# video files, server/.data and anything else that lands in the repo root.
*

# workspace manifests + lockfile (pnpm install --frozen-lockfile)
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml

# @pitwall/sim (workspace dependency of the server, plain .ts)
!packages/sim/package.json
!packages/sim/src/

# server (no tests, no local data)
!server/package.json
!server/src/

# Anchor IDL only (server/src/chain.ts requires ../../target/idl/pitwall.json)
!target/idl/pitwall.json

# Godot project for the headless re-drive (re-imported in the image)
!game/

# prebuilt web export from tools/build-web.cmd (not rebuilt in the image)
!build/web/

# logos and link-preview images served at /brand/*
!brand/

# entrypoint
!deploy/start.sh

# junk inside the re-included folders
game/.godot/
game/android/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.tmp
**/*.translation
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.webm
